rem Falling Bottles
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=726

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Bottles integer = 10000
arg Prime integer = 1000000033

rem Removing all bottles counts the
rem linear extensions of the triangle
rem poset: by the hook formula
rem f(n) = T! prod over h of R_h^(n-h+1)
rem with T = n (n + 1) / 2 and R_h =
rem (2^h - 1) / (2h - 1). Prefix
rem products of R give Q, and of Q the
rem powers; T! is a prefix product too.
fun A mulp B = A * B mod Prime
Layers = 1 to Bottles
Numerator = (2 Layers Prime powmod) - 1
Odd = 2 * Layers - 1
Power = Prime - 2
Inverse = Odd Power Prime powmod
Ratio = Numerator * Inverse mod Prime
Prefix = Ratio scan mulp
Powers = Prefix scan mulp
Triangle = Layers * (Layers + 1) // 2
Top = Bottles * (Bottles + 1) // 2
Facts = (1 to Top) scan mulp
Chosen = Facts (Triangle - 1)
Terms = Chosen * Powers mod Prime
Answer = Terms sum mod Prime
return Answer
